  "term": "Versed",
  "definition": "Versed is midazolam hydrochloride, a short-acting benzodiazepine with calming, memory-impairing, sleep-inducing, anticonvulsant, and sedating effects. It acts in the central nervous system by increasing GABA-related inhibition at benzodiazepine receptor sites.",
